1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,180
Use simple English to ask again, repeat the key words, and confirm the next step at a station.

2
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:13,760
This lesson continues the earlier transport topic, but it keeps one connected station job.

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,300
The traveler is at Central Station.

4
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:23,100
The route is simple: take the Green Line from Platform 2, change at City Hall, and get off at Riverside.

5
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,780
The useful repair is also simple.

6
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,480
Ask again.

7
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,640
Repeat the key words.

8
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,440
Confirm the next step before you walk.

9
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,300
Warm-Up Questions.

10
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:41,040
When someone speaks too fast, do you ask again?

11
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:47,880
What information do you need before you move: line, platform, change station, or stop?

12
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:51,240
Do you repeat important words to check?

13
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:55,740
What short phrase can you use when you are not sure?

14
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:57,840
Ask again

15
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:58,860
Excuse me.

16
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,860
Which train goes to Riverside?

17
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,100
Take the Green Line from Platform 2.

18
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:06,080
Sorry, one more time?

19
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,560
Green Line.

20
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:09,080
Platform 2.

21
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:11,020
Green Line, Platform 2.

22
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:12,540
I will go there now.

23
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,480
Thank you.

24
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,720
That's right.

25
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:17,460
The stairs to Platform 2 are on your left.

26
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:19,240
Check before walking

27
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:20,680
Excuse me.

28
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:21,860
Is this Platform 2?

29
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:22,960
Yes.

30
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,640
Platform 2 is downstairs.

31
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:27,540
Downstairs, then right?

32
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:28,240
Yes.

33
00:01:28,260 --> 00:01:31,480
Go down, turn right, and follow the green signs.

34
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:34,260
Down, right, green signs.

35
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:36,120
Thank you.

36
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:36,820
Good.

37
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:39,800
You are going the right way.

38
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:41,320
Confirm the change

39
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,320
Excuse me.

40
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,020
Do I change at City Hall?

41
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:45,060
Yes.

42
00:01:45,060 --> 00:01:47,100
Change at City Hall for Riverside.

43
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:50,740
City Hall, then the small train?

44
00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:51,780
That's right.

45
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:53,560
Follow the Riverside sign after you get off.

46
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:55,000
Okay.

47
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,080
City Hall, Riverside sign.

48
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,140
Thank you.

49
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:01,040
You're welcome.

50
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,520
You have the next step.

51
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:03,660
Check the stop

52
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,020
Excuse me.

53
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:07,000
Is Riverside the next stop?

54
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:07,900
Yes.

55
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:10,400
Riverside is next.

56
00:02:10,740 --> 00:02:11,440
Great.

57
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:12,340
I will get ready.

58
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:13,620
Good idea.

59
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:15,160
The doors open on the right.

60
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,620
Thank you.

61
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,720
That helps.

62
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:18,980
No problem.

63
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,900
Have a good trip.

64
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:25,640
Fast transport English can feel difficult, but the small repair is to ask again.

65
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:28,060
Repeat the important words.

66
00:02:29,660 --> 00:02:32,140
Confirm the next action before you move.

67
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:34,540
You do not need long English.

68
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:40,820
You need one clear question, one clear repeat, and one clear next step.

69
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,300
Good work.

70
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:49,480
Ask one clear question, repeat the important words, and move when your next step is clear.
